commit 48114eedf3c3d4a682a6b1d644cc5af5c2945d10
Author: Yuri Khrustalev <ykhrustalev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 13:35:27 2026 -0400

    Read transformers 5 keys in LFM2-VL configs (#695)
    
    transformers 5 writes the LFM2 MLP width as intermediate_size, keeps
    rope_theta under rope_parameters, and can untie the output head with a
    top-level tie_word_embeddings or tie_embedding. LFM2VL now reads all
    three. An untied model gets an lm_head, and sanitize maps a top-level
    lm_head into the language model.
    
    With this, LiquidAI/d1-3B loads and chats as an LFM2-VL model.

