commit 4cc55045125335a245f74ab1d817e9d261a7e85a
Author: Alessio Pollero <alessio.pollero@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 12 23:18:02 2026 +0200

    Add Qwen 3.8 support for text, VLM, and MTP speculative decoding (#545)
    
    * Add Qwen 3.8 support for text, VLM, and MTP speculative decoding
    
    - Register qwen3_8, qwen3_8_text, and qwen3_8_moe architectures in LLMTypeRegistry and VLMTypeRegistry
    - Add qwen3_8_27b_4bit and qwen3_8_27b_8bit model configuration presets to LLMRegistry and VLMRegistry
    - Add Qwen3_5VLProcessor and Qwen3_8VLProcessor aliases to VLMProcessorTypeRegistry
    - Add dynamic layer_types decoding and faIdx full-attention layer index resolution
    - Harden weight sanitization across MLXLLM and MLXVLM for multimodal and text-only checkpoint loading
    - Register Qwen 3.8 MTP draft model types in MTPDrafterTypeRegistry
    - Add comprehensive Qwen38Tests unit test suite
    
    * Update Qwen 3.8 loading for component-aware checkpoints
    * Load Qwen vision on first media use
    * Fix Qwen vision loading test fixture

