commit 91a9565cace9626fd87ba8f221b1efa8bda01ad9
Author: Mauro Barchiesi <139244198+MBark286@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 9 17:33:15 2026 +0200

    MLXEmbedders: build the README example mask from text lengths (#685)
    
    * MLXEmbedders: build the README example mask from text lengths
    
    The "Generate embeddings" example pads every text with the EOS token
    and builds the attention mask as `padded .!= eosTokenId`. Tokenizers
    that end every text with a real EOS token, such as EmbeddingGemma's,
    then lose that token as well: the mask hides it from pooling and, since
    #654, from attention.
    
    Build the mask from the real lengths instead, in the same shape as the
    padding above it.
    
    EmbeddingGemma (mlx-community/embeddinggemma-300m-bf16) in float32, an
    EOS-padded batch of an 11-token query and a 548-token text, cosine
    against sentence-transformers: 0.776 and 0.969 with the old mask,
    1.00000 for both rows with the new one.

