commit 1830ae4f3fbeabff69850cbf906c62a12ea825af
Author: spokvulcan <ivanchenko.b@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 2 19:22:13 2026 +0300

    Declare the fused GDN projection as compile state so it frees with the model (#631)
    
    Fix memory leak from unregistered fused GDN projections in Qwen3.5
    
    Because `prepare()` does not register the fused projection as a child of `Qwen35GatedDeltaNet`, traces treated its arrays as tape constants rather than state. Due to ml-explore/mlx#3932, these constants remained resident after function erasure, leaking ~2.3 GB per reload on 27B.
    
    Traces running GDN layers now explicitly declare the fused module as compile state. Verified with `testCompiledDecodeReleasesFusedProjectionWithTheModel`.

